# Context Caching

## Objective

Do not re-read the same files and re-grep the same patterns unnecessarily within a task. Reuse valid prior analysis.

## Requirements

- Re-read when files may have changed since last read.
- Invalidate assumptions after edits or new user constraints.
- Prefer targeted reads over full-repo scans when scope is known.

